#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:4
msgid "Interface Overview"
msgstr "界面概述"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:6
msgid "|UI_1|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:8
msgid ""
"OpenToonz interface is organized into rooms, also known as workspaces: each "
"room is a different collection of windows which are laid out at specific "
"positions on the screen."
msgstr ""
"OpenToonz界面被组织成多个房间，也称为工作区：每个房间都是一组不同的窗口，这些窗"
"口排列在屏幕上的特定位置。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:14
msgid "Using Rooms"
msgstr "使用房间"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:16
msgid "|UI_rooms|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:18
msgid ""
"Available rooms are listed on the far right of the menu bar. Each of them "
"always displays the content of the current scene."
msgstr "菜单栏的最右侧列出了可用的房间。它们中的每一个都始终显示当前场景的内容。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:20
msgid ""
"Rooms can be named and their order can be rearranged. New rooms can be added "
"and existing rooms can be deleted. When a room is added it is empty; to "
"configure it, panes can be added one by one (see below)."
msgstr ""
"房间可以命名，也可以重新排列顺序。可以添加新房间，也可以删除现有房间。当添加一个"
"房间时，它是空的；要配置它，可以逐个添加窗格（见下文）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:23
msgid "**To enter a room:**"
msgstr "**进入房间:**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:25
msgid "Click the related tab on the far right of the menu bar."
msgstr "单击菜单栏最右侧的相关选项卡。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:27
msgid "**To name a room:**"
msgstr "**为房间命名:**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:29
msgid "Double-click the tab and type the name you want to assign to the room."
msgstr "双击选项卡，然后键入要分配给房间的名称。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:31
msgid "**To order room tabs:**"
msgstr "**排序房间选项卡:**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:33
msgid "Click and drag the tab to the new position."
msgstr "单击并将选项卡拖动到新位置。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:35
msgid "**To add a new room:**"
msgstr "**添加新房间:**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:37
msgid ""
"Right-click in the room tab area and choose New Room from the menu that opens."
msgstr "在房间选项卡区域中单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择“新建房间”。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:39
msgid "**To delete a room:**"
msgstr "**删除房间:**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:41
msgid ""
"Right-click the room tab and choose Delete Room \"<Name>\" from the menu that "
"opens. The current room cannot be deleted."
msgstr ""
"右键单击房间选项卡，然后从打开的菜单中选择删除房间“＜名称＞”。无法删除当前房间。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:43
msgid "**To return to the set of rooms provided with OpenToonz:**"
msgstr "**要返回OpenToonz提供的房间集，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:45
msgid "Choose Windows  →  Workspace  →  **Reset to Default Rooms**."
msgstr "选择Windows→  工作区→  **重置为默认房间**。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:51
msgid "Customizing Rooms"
msgstr "自定义房间"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:52
msgid ""
"Rooms can be modified by setting different sizes to different panes, and adding "
"or removing panes. To prevent the accidental addition or removal of panes, "
"rooms configuration can be locked."
msgstr ""
"通过为不同的窗格设置不同的大小，以及添加或删除窗格，可以修改房间。为了防止意外添"
"加或移除窗格，可以锁定房间配置。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:54
msgid ""
"Most of the panes can be maximized to fill the full interface, and can be added "
"as floating windows by using the Windows menu."
msgstr ""
"大多数窗格可以最大化以填充整个界面，并且可以使用windows菜单添加为浮动窗口。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:57
msgid "**To resize a pane in the room:**"
msgstr "**要调整房间中窗格的大小，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:59
msgid ""
"Click any vertical or horizontal separator and drag it to the new position."
msgstr "单击任何垂直或水平分隔符并将其拖动到新位置。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:61
msgid ""
"Some panes like the toolbar and the level strip have some fixed size, therefore "
"they cannot be resized."
msgstr "某些窗格（如工具栏和水平条）具有固定大小，因此无法调整其大小。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:63
msgid "**To open a pane as a floating window:**"
msgstr "**要将窗格作为浮动窗口打开，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:65
msgid "Select in the Windows menu the pane you want to open."
msgstr "在Windows菜单中选择要打开的窗格。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:67
msgid "**To resize a floating window:**"
msgstr "**要调整浮动窗口的大小，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:69
msgid "Click and drag the border or corner of a window."
msgstr "单击并拖动窗口的边框或角。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:71
msgid "**To close a floating window or a dialog:**"
msgstr "**要关闭浮动窗口或对话框，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:73
msgid "Click the close button at the right of the title bar."
msgstr "单击标题栏右侧的关闭按钮。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:75
msgid "**To add a pane to a room:**"
msgstr "**要向房间添加窗格，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:77
msgid "Use the Windows menu to open the pane as a floating window."
msgstr "使用“窗口”菜单将窗格作为浮动窗口打开。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:79
msgid ""
"Click and drag its title bar to move it around and release to dock it according "
"to the highlighted insertion point."
msgstr "单击并拖动其标题栏以移动它，然后释放以根据突出显示的插入点将其停靠。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:81
msgid ""
"Trying to dock a pane to the leftmost/rightmost part of the interface may fail "
"if the main OpenToonz window is maximized at that moment. To overcome this, you "
"can restore the main window size, dock the desired pane, and then maximize it "
"back."
msgstr ""
"如果此时OpenToonz主窗口最大化，尝试将窗格停靠在界面的最左侧/最右侧可能会失败。为"
"了克服这个问题，您可以恢复主窗口大小，停靠所需的窗格，然后将其最大化。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:83
msgid "**To remove a pane from a room:**"
msgstr "**要从房间中删除窗格，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:85
msgid ""
"Click and drag the title bar of the pane you want to remove to undock it from "
"the room."
msgstr "单击并拖动要删除的窗格的标题栏，将其从文件室中拔出。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:87
msgid "Close the floating window."
msgstr "关闭浮动窗口。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:89
msgid "**To maximize, or minimize a maximized pane:**"
msgstr "**要最大化或最小化最大化窗格，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:91
msgid "Double-click its title bar."
msgstr "双击它的标题条"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:93
msgid ""
"Some panes like the toolbar and the level strip have some fixed size, therefore "
"they cannot be maximized."
msgstr "某些窗格（如工具栏和水平条）具有固定大小，因此无法将其最大化。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:95
msgid "**To lock/unlock the rooms configuration:**"
msgstr "**要锁定/解锁房间配置：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:97
msgid ""
"Activate/deactivate the Windows  →  Workspace  →  **Lock Room Panes** option."
msgstr "激活/停用Windows→  工作区→  **锁室窗格**选项。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:103
msgid "Room Panes"
msgstr "房间窗格"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:104
msgid ""
"Below there is a list of the panes (in the same order in which they appear in "
"the Windows menu) that can be used to build rooms and that can be opened as "
"floating windows."
msgstr ""
"下面是一个窗格列表（与它们在Windows菜单中的显示顺序相同），可用于构建房间，也可"
"以作为浮动窗口打开。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:110
msgid "Batch Servers"
msgstr "批处理服务器"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:112
msgid "|UI_batch|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:114
msgid ""
"The Batch Servers window allows you to process the batch list by using the "
"render farm, and contains information about the list of server (rendering) "
"nodes defined for the farm."
msgstr ""
"批处理服务器窗口允许您使用渲染场处理批处理列表，并包含有关为场定义的服务器（渲"
"染）节点列表的信息。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:116
msgid "See  :ref:`Monitoring the Server Nodes <monitoring_the_server_nodes>`  ."
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`监视服务器节点<Monitoring_the_Server_Nodes>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:122
msgid "Cleanup Settings"
msgstr "清理设置"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:124
msgid "|UI_cleanup|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:126
msgid ""
"The Cleanup Settings pane allows you to define the parameters for the clean-up "
"process of scanned raster images, in order to convert them into Toonz Raster "
"images, ready to be painted in OpenToonz."
msgstr ""
"“清理设置”窗格允许您定义扫描光栅图像的清理过程的参数，以便将其转换为Toonz光栅图"
"像，准备在OpenToonz中绘制。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:128
msgid "See  :ref:`Cleaning-up Scanned Drawings <cleaning-up_scanned_drawings>`  ."
msgstr "请参阅:ref:`清理扫描图纸<cleanin-gup_Scanned_trawings>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:134
msgid "Color Model"
msgstr "颜色模式"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:136
msgid "|UI_colormodel|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:138
msgid ""
"The color model viewer displays the image, or animation level, you loaded as "
"reference to paint the current animation level."
msgstr "颜色模式查看器显示您加载的图像或动画级别，作为绘制当前动画级别的参考。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:140
msgid "See  :ref:`Using a Color Model <using_a_color_model>`  ."
msgstr "请参阅：ref:`使用颜色模型<Using_a_Color_Model>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:146
msgid "File Browser"
msgstr "文件浏览器"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:148
msgid "|UI_filebrowser|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:150
msgid ""
"The file browser allows you to load and save files, and to access projects."
msgstr "文件浏览器允许你加载和保存文件，并且处理工程。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:152
msgid ""
"On the left there is a file tree with some main folders containing material "
"stored on your computer: My Computer, Network, My Documents, History, Library "
"and Projects. You can open folders and sub-folders in order to retrieve files "
"that are displayed in the area on the right."
msgstr ""
"左侧是一个文件树，其中包含一些主要文件夹，其中包含存储在您计算机上的材料：我的电"
"脑、网络、我的文档、历史、库和项目。您可以打开文件夹和子文件夹，以检索右侧区域中"
"显示的文件。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:154
msgid ""
"See  :ref:`Managing Projects <managing_projects>`  and  :ref:`Using the File "
"Browser <using_the_file_browser>`  ."
msgstr ""
"请参阅：ref:`管理项目<manageing_Projects>`和：ref:`使用文件浏览器"
"<Using_the_File_Browser>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:160
msgid "Flipbook"
msgstr "翻页书"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:162
msgid "|UI_flipbook|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:164
msgid ""
"The flipbook can display animation levels, clips or sequences of images. It can "
"be used to check levels for instance before loading them, or to control a "
"rendered sequence."
msgstr ""
"动画书可以显示动画级别、剪辑或图像序列。它可用于在加载级别之前检查级别，或控制渲"
"染序列。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:166
msgid "See  :ref:`Using the Flipbook <using_the_flipbook>`  ."
msgstr "请参阅：ref:“使用动画书<Using_the_Flipbook>”。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:172
msgid "Function Editor"
msgstr "函数编辑器"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:174
msgid "|UI_functioneditor|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:176
msgid ""
"The function editor maps objects and FX transformations with key values and "
"related interpolations by using a spreadsheet or a graph editor. It is divided "
"into two sections: on the left there is an area where the spreadsheet or graph "
"editor is displayed, on the right top is an area where the interpolation of the "
"current transformation segment is displayed, and on the right bottom is the "
"objects/FX tree."
msgstr ""
"函数编辑器通过使用电子表格或图形编辑器，将对象和FX转换与键值和相关插值进行映射。"
"它分为两部分：左侧是显示电子表格或图形编辑器的区域，右上角是显示当前变换段插值的"
"区域，而右下角是对象/FX树。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:178
msgid "See  :ref:`Using the Function Editor <using_the_function_editor>`  ."
msgstr "请参阅：ref:`使用函数编辑器<Using_the_functioneditor>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:184
msgid "Level Strip"
msgstr "标高条"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:186
msgid "|UI_levelstrip|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:188
msgid ""
"The level strip displays the sequence of drawings belonging to the level "
"currently selected in the Xsheet."
msgstr "标高条显示属于Xsheet中当前选定标高的图形序列。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:190
msgid ""
"It helps you to edit the sequence of drawings and to see all the drawings of "
"the current level, even if those drawings are not exposed in a Xsheet."
msgstr ""
"它可以帮助您编辑图形序列并查看当前级别的所有图形，即使这些图形未在Xsheet中显示。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:192
msgid "See  :ref:`Editing Animation Levels <editing_animation_levels>`  ."
msgstr "请参见：ref:`编辑动画级别<Editing_Animation_Levels>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:198
msgid "Palette"
msgstr "调色板"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:200
msgid "|UI_palette|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:202
msgid ""
"It displays the styles defined for the current level, or in case it is inactive "
"the styles defined for a previously selected level."
msgstr ""
"它显示为当前级别定义的样式，如果它处于非活动状态，则显示为以前选定的级别定义的风"
"格。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:204
msgid "See  :ref:`The Palette Window <the_palette_window>`  ."
msgstr "请参见：ref:`调色板窗口<The_palete_Window>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:210
msgid "Scene Cast"
msgstr "场景演员"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:212
msgid "|UI_scenecast|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:214
msgid ""
"The scene cast pane lets you control the files loaded in the scene, save them "
"and load new ones. It can be organized in folders and sub-folders."
msgstr ""
"场景投射窗格允许您控制场景中加载的文件，保存它们并加载新文件。它可以组织在文件夹"
"和子文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:216
msgid "See  :ref:`Using the Scene Cast <using_the_scene_cast>`  ."
msgstr "请参见：ref:`使用场景投射<Using_the_Scene_Cast>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:222
msgid "Schematic"
msgstr "摄影图"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:224
msgid "|UI_schematic|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:226
msgid ""
"The schematic can alternatively display stage information or special FX usage."
msgstr "该示意图（摄影图）也可以显示舞台信息或特殊的FX使用情况。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:228
msgid ""
"The stage schematic displays as nodes all the objects defined in a scene, i.e. "
"columns, pegbars, cameras, the table and motion paths, and allows you to manage "
"the way they are linked to each other."
msgstr ""
"舞台示意图将场景中定义的所有对象（即柱、钉杆、摄影机、桌子和运动路径）显示为节"
"点，并允许您管理它们彼此链接的方式。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:230
msgid ""
"The FX schematic allows you to apply FX to the content of Xsheet columns, and "
"to manage the way they are applied. All the columns and FX are displayed as "
"nodes that can be connected in order to set the way FX affect the scene content."
msgstr ""
"FX原理图允许您将FX应用于Xsheet列的内容，并管理其应用方式。所有列和FX都显示为可以"
"连接的节点，以设置FX影响场景内容的方式。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:232
msgid ""
"See  :ref:`Using the Stage Schematic <using_the_stage_schematic>`  and  :ref:"
"`Using the FX Schematic <using_the_fx_schematic>`  ."
msgstr ""
"请参阅：ref:`使用舞台示意图<Using_the_Stage_Schematic>`和：ref:`使用FX示意图"
"<Using _the_FX_schemaic>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:238
msgid "Studio Palette"
msgstr "工作室调色板"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:240
msgid "|UI_studiopalette|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:242
msgid ""
"The studio palette allows you to store an unlimited number of level palettes. "
"From here any palette can be retrieved and assigned to the current level in "
"order to paint it, with no need to define the same styles again and again. It "
"also includes a viewer displaying the styles of the currently selected palette."
msgstr ""
"工作室调色板允许您存储无限数量的关卡调色板。从这里可以检索任何调色板并将其分配给"
"当前级别进行绘制，而不需要一次又一次地定义相同的样式。它还包括一个显示当前选定调"
"色板样式的查看器。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:244
msgid "See  :ref:`Using the Studio Palette <using_the_studio_palette>`  ."
msgstr "请参阅：ref:`使用工作室调色板<Using_the_Studio_palete>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:250
msgid "Style Editor"
msgstr "样式编辑器"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:252
msgid "|UI_styleeditor|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:254
msgid ""
"The style editor allows you to modify the palette styles. You can choose the "
"type of style among color, texture, vector and raster. There also is a settings "
"tab where you can decide some parameters for the style."
msgstr ""
"样式编辑器允许您修改调色板样式。您可以在颜色、纹理、矢量和光栅中选择样式类型。还"
"有一个设置选项卡，您可以在其中决定样式的一些参数。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:256
msgid "See  :ref:`Editing Styles <editing_styles>`  ."
msgstr "请参见：ref:`编辑样式<Editing_Styles>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:262
msgid "Tasks"
msgstr "任务"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:264
msgid "|UI_tasks|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:266
msgid ""
"The Tasks window contains the task tree with all the tasks submitted to the "
"batch processing, and information about the task currently selected in the "
"tree. From the task tree you can start or stop a task execution, or remove it."
msgstr ""
"“任务”窗口包含任务树，其中包含提交到批处理的所有任务，以及有关树中当前选定任务的"
"信息。从任务树中，您可以启动或停止任务执行，或将其删除。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:268
msgid ""
"See  :ref:`Managing and Executing Render Tasks "
"<managing_and_executing_render_tasks>`  ."
msgstr "请参阅：ref:`管理和执行渲染任务<manageing_andexecuting_Render_Tasks>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:274
msgid "Message Center"
msgstr "消息中心"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:276
msgid "|UI_messagecenter|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:278
msgid ""
"The message center displays in a list the messages OpenToonz is sending to the "
"user. You can set filters on the messages showed in the window using the "
"appropriate radio buttons, or you can clear the list completely by pressing the "
"Clear button."
msgstr ""
"消息中心以列表形式显示OpenToonz正在向用户发送的消息。您可以使用相应的单选按钮对"
"窗口中显示的消息设置过滤器，也可以按清除按钮完全清除列表。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:284
msgid "Toolbar"
msgstr "工具条"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:286
msgid "|UI_toolbar|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:288
msgid ""
"The toolbar contains tools to draw, select and edit drawings, and to animate "
"objects like the camera, columns and pegbars. The tools in the toolbar can only "
"be used in the main viewer."
msgstr ""
"工具栏包含用于绘制、选择和编辑图形以及为摄影机、柱和钉杆等对象设置动画的工具。工"
"具栏中的工具只能在主查看器中使用。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:290
msgid ""
"If the toolbar is too short to display all the tools, it can be scrolled by "
"using arrow buttons available at its ends."
msgstr "如果工具栏太短，无法显示所有工具，可以使用其末端的箭头按钮进行滚动。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:292
msgid ""
"|animate| **Animate** modifies the position, rotation and size of the current "
"objects (see  :ref:`Animating Objects <animating_objects>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|animate|**动画**修改当前对象的位置、旋转和大小（请参见：ref:`为对象设置动画"
"<animation_objects>`）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:297
msgid ""
"|selection| **Selection** performs a selection and transforms it (see  :ref:"
"`Using the Selection Tool <using_the_selection_tool>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|selection|**选择**执行选择并对其进行变换（请参阅：ref:“使用选择工具"
"<Using_the_selection_Tool>”）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:302
msgid ""
"|brush| **Brush** draws in the work area in freehand mode (see  :ref:`Drawing "
"with the Brush Tool <drawing_with_the_brush_tool>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|brush|**画笔**以徒手模式在工作区中绘制（参见：ref:`使用画笔工具绘制"
"<Drawing_with_the_brush_Tool>`）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:307
msgid ""
"|geometric| **Geometric** draws geometric shapes (see  :ref:`Drawing with the "
"Geometric Tool <drawing_with_the_geometric_tool>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|geometric|**几何工具**绘制几何形状（参见：“使用几何工具绘制"
"<Drawing_with_the_geometric_Tool>”）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:312
msgid ""
"|type| **Type** adds text by setting the font and size (see  :ref:`Adding Text "
"<adding_text>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|type|**type**通过设置字体和大小来添加文本（请参阅：ref:`添加文本"
"<Adding_text>`）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:317
msgid ""
"|fill| **Fill** fills drawing areas with the current style (see  :ref:`Filling "
"Areas <filling_areas>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|fill|**fill**用当前样式填充绘图区域（请参见：ref:`填充区域<Filling_areas>`）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:322
msgid ""
"|paint_brush| **Paint Brush** paints lines and areas in Toonz raster drawings "
"in freehand mode. (see  :ref:`Filling Areas <filling_areas>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|paint_brush|**画笔**以徒手模式在Toanz光栅图中绘制线条和区域。（参见：ref:“填充"
"区域<Filling_Areas>”）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:327
msgid ""
"|eraser| **Eraser** deletes vectors in vector drawings, and painted areas and "
"lines in raster drawings (see  :ref:`Drawing Tools <drawing_tools>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|橡皮擦|**橡皮擦**删除矢量图形中的矢量，以及光栅图形中的绘制区域和线条（请参阅："
"ref:“绘图工具<Drawing_Tools>”）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:332
msgid ""
"|tape| **Tape** joins two open ends of one or two vectors in vector drawings, "
"or closes gaps in raster drawings (see  :ref:`Joining and Splitting "
"<joining_and_splitting>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|tape|**修正带**在矢量图形中连接一个或两个矢量的两个开口端，或在光栅图形中闭合间"
"隙（参见：ref:`连接和拆分<Joining_and_Splitting>`）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:337
msgid ""
"|style_picker| **Style Picker** picks a style from the current drawing, that "
"becomes the current style in the palette and in the style editor."
msgstr ""
"|style_picker|**样式选择器**从当前图形中选择一个样式，该样式将成为调色板和样式编"
"辑器中的当前样式。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:342
msgid ""
"|RGB_picker| **RGB Picker** picks red, green and blue values from the viewer "
"content, and applies them to the current style (see  :ref:`Plain Colors "
"<plain_colors>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|RGB_picker|**RGB picker**从查看器内容中选取红色、绿色和蓝色值，并将其应用于当前"
"样式（请参阅：ref:“纯色<Plain_Colors>”）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:347
msgid ""
"|cpe| **Control Point Editor** modifies the vector shape by editing its control "
"points (see  :ref:`Editing Vector Control Points "
"<editing_vector_control_points>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|cpe|**控制点编辑器**通过编辑其控制点来修改矢量形状（请参阅：ref:`编辑矢量控制点"
"<editing_vector_Control_points>`）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:352
msgid ""
"|pinch| **Pinch** modifies the vector shape by clicking and dragging anywhere "
"on the vector (see  :ref:`Changing the Bend of Vectors "
"<changing_the_bend_of_vectors>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|pinch |**pinch**通过单击并拖动矢量上的任何位置来修改矢量形状（参见：ref:`更改矢"
"量的弯曲<Changing_the_Bend_of_Vectors>`）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:357
msgid ""
"|pump| **Pump** locally modifies the vector thickness by clicking on the "
"section you want to affect and then dragging up or down (see  :ref:`Using Other "
"Modifier Tools <using_other_modifier_tools>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|pump |**pump**通过单击要影响的截面，然后向上或向下拖动来本地修改矢量厚度（请参"
"阅：ref:`使用其他修改器工具<Using_Other_Modifier_Tools>）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:362
msgid ""
"|magnet| **Magnet** deforms several vectors at once by clicking the area you "
"want to affect and dragging (see  :ref:`Using Other Modifier Tools "
"<using_other_modifier_tools>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|磁铁|**磁铁**通过单击要影响的区域并拖动，一次变形多个矢量（请参见：ref:“使用其"
"他修改器工具<Using_Other_Modifier_Tools>”）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:367
msgid ""
"|bender| **Bender** bends vectors in vector drawings (see  :ref:`Using Other "
"Modifier Tools <using_other_modifier_tools>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|bender |**bender**在矢量图形中弯曲矢量（参见：ref:“使用其他修改器工具<使用"
"_Other_Modifier_Tools>”）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:372
msgid ""
"|iron| **Iron** removes creases from vectors by moving the cursor on the vector "
"you want to flatten (see  :ref:`Using Other Modifier Tools "
"<using_other_modifier_tools>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|iron|**iron**通过将光标移动到要展平的向量上来消除向量上的折痕（请参见：ref:“使"
"用其他修改器工具<Using_Other_Modifier_Tools>”）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:377
msgid ""
"|cutter| **Cutter** splits a vector in two sections when clicking on it (see  :"
"ref:`Joining and Splitting <joining_and_splitting>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|cutter |**cutter**在单击向量时将其分为两部分（参见：ref:`连接和拆分"
"<Joining_and_Splitting>`）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:382
msgid ""
"|skeleton| **Skeleton** defines character models, and animates them as in "
"cutout animation (see  :ref:`Using the Skeleton Tool "
"<using_the_skeleton_tool>`  )"
msgstr ""
"|skeleton|**skeleton**定义角色模型，并将其设置为剪切动画中的动画（请参见：ref:`"
"使用骨架工具<Using_the_skeleton_Tool>`）"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:387
msgid ""
"|hook| **Hook** defines reference points to be used in the stage schematic to "
"move an object, or link one object to another (see  :ref:`Using Hooks "
"<using_hooks>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|hook|**hook**定义了在阶段示意图中用于移动对象或将一个对象链接到另一个对象的参考"
"点（请参阅：ref:`Using Hooks<Using_Hooks>`）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:392
msgid ""
"|tracker| **Tracker** tracks specific regions in a sequence of images (see  :"
"ref:`Tracking Points <tracking_points>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|tracker|**tracker**跟踪一系列图像中的特定区域（请参阅：ref:“跟踪点"
"<Tracking_Points>”）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:397
msgid ""
"|plastic| **Plastic** builds a mesh that allows to deform and animate a "
"character or part of it (see  :ref:`Using Plastic tool <using_plastic_tool>`  )."
msgstr ""
"|plastic |**plastic**构建一个网格，允许变形和设置角色或其部分的动画（请参见："
"ref:`使用塑料工具<Using_plastic_tool>`）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:402
msgid ""
"|zoom| **Zoom** zooms in and out the viewer content; after you click you can "
"drag up to zoom in the work area, or drag down to zoom out."
msgstr ""
"|zoom|**zoom**放大和缩小查看器内容；单击后，您可以向上拖动以放大工作区域，或向下"
"拖动以缩小。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:407
msgid ""
"|hand| **Hand** pans over the viewer content; if the 3D view is activated, the "
"Hand tool lets you pan over the 3D view as well."
msgstr ""
"|手|**手**在观众内容上平移；如果激活了三维视图，则“手”工具也允许您在三维视图上平"
"移。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:412
msgid ""
"|rotate| **Rotate** rotates the viewer content; if the 3D view is activated, "
"the Rotate tool lets you change the point of view."
msgstr ""
"|rotate|**旋转**旋转查看器内容；如果激活了三维视图，则“旋转”工具允许您更改观察"
"点。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:418
msgid "Tool Options Bar"
msgstr "工具选项栏"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:420
msgid "|UI_tooloptionsbar|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:422
msgid ""
"The tool options bar displays settings for the current tool, if it has any."
msgstr "工具选项栏显示当前工具的设置（如果有的话）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:424
msgid ""
"For example it lets you set the thickness and other properties of the Brush "
"tool."
msgstr "例如，它允许您设置画笔工具的厚度和其他属性。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:426
msgid ""
"If the tool options bar is too short to display all the tool options, it can be "
"scrolled by using arrow buttons available at its ends."
msgstr ""
"如果工具选项栏太短，无法显示所有工具选项，可以使用其末端的箭头按钮进行滚动。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:432
msgid "Command Bar"
msgstr "命令栏"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:434
msgid "|UI_commandbar|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:436
msgid ""
"The Command Bar is a place where the user can display favorite OpenToonz tools "
"and commands to have them readily available."
msgstr "命令栏是用户可以显示喜爱的OpenToonz工具和命令的地方，以便随时使用。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:438
msgid "The Command Bar pane can be docked in any part of the OpenToonz UI."
msgstr "命令栏窗格可以停靠在OpenToonz UI的任何部分。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:440
msgid ""
"If the Command Bar is too short to display all the command buttons, a double-"
"arrow symbol will appear at the right end of it, allowing to display a drop "
"down menu with the rest of them."
msgstr ""
"如果命令栏太短，无法显示所有命令按钮，则其右端将出现一个双箭头符号，允许显示包含"
"其余按钮的下拉菜单。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:442
msgid "**To display the Command Bar:**"
msgstr "**要显示命令栏，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:444
msgid "Choose Windows  →  **Command Bar**."
msgstr "选择Windows→  **命令栏**。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:446
msgid "**To customize the Command Bar buttons:**"
msgstr "**要自定义命令栏按钮，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:448
msgid "Choose Windows  →  **Command Bar** to open the Command Bar."
msgstr "Choose Windows  →  **Command Bar** to open the Command Bar."

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:450
msgid ""
"Right click on it and select **Customize Command Bar** from the menu that "
"opens. The Customize Command Bar window will open."
msgstr ""
"右键单击它，然后从打开的菜单中选择**自定义命令栏**。“自定义命令栏”窗口将打开。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:452
msgid "|UI_commandbar_window|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:454
msgid ""
"To *add* a command: Search for a command in the **Toolbar Items** list (right) "
"and drag it to the **Command Bar** list (left)."
msgstr ""
"要*添加*命令：在**工具栏项目**列表（右）中搜索命令，并将其拖动到**命令栏**列表"
"（左）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:456
msgid ""
"To *add* a separator: At the end of the **Toolbar Items** list (right), drag "
"the **----Separator----** item to the **Command Bar** list (left)."
msgstr ""
"添加分隔符：在**工具栏项目**列表（右）末尾，将**----分隔符----**项目拖动到**命令"
"栏**列表（左）。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:458
msgid ""
"To *delete* a command: Locate the command in the **Command Bar** list (left), "
"right click on it and select **Remove** from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"要*删除*命令：在**命令栏**列表（左）中找到该命令，右键单击它，然后从打开的菜单中"
"选择**删除**。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:460
msgid "Click **OK** to accept the changes or **Cancel** to discard them."
msgstr "Click **OK** to accept the changes or **Cancel** to discard them."

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:466
msgid "Viewer"
msgstr "查看器"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:468
msgid "|UI_viewer|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:470
msgid ""
"The viewer is the work area where you can draw images and see at the same time "
"the result of your compositing. It is endless and you can scroll, zoom in, zoom "
"out and rotate it the way you prefer."
msgstr ""
"查看器是您可以绘制图像并同时查看合成结果的工作区域。它是无尽的，你可以滚动、放"
"大、缩小和以你喜欢的方式旋转它。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:472 ../../source/interface_overview.rst:487
msgid ""
"It has different modes of visualization among which you can choose the more "
"suitable to the operation you are performing."
msgstr "它有不同的可视化模式，您可以在其中选择更适合您正在执行的操作的模式。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:474 ../../source/interface_overview.rst:489
msgid ""
"See  :ref:`Using the Viewer <using_the_work_area>`  and  :ref:`Previewing the "
"Animation <previewing_the_animation>`  ."
msgstr ""
"请参阅：ref:`使用查看器<Using_the_work_area>`和：ref:`预览动画"
"<Previewing_the_Animation>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:480
msgid "ComboViewer"
msgstr "组合查看器"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:482
msgid "|UI_comboviewer|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:484
msgid ""
"The comboviewer integrates in a single pane a viewer, horizontal toolbar and a "
"tool options bar. It's and alternative work area where you can draw images and "
"see at the same time the result of your compositing. It is endless and you can "
"scroll, zoom in, zoom out and rotate it the way you prefer."
msgstr ""
"组合视图将查看器、水平工具栏和工具选项栏集成在一个窗格中。这是一个替代工作区，您"
"可以在这里绘制图像，同时查看合成结果。它是无尽的，你可以滚动、放大、缩小和以你喜"
"欢的方式旋转它。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:495
msgid "Xsheet"
msgstr "摄影表"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:497
msgid "|UI_xsheet|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:499
msgid ""
"The Xsheet allows you to manage the scene content, in the same manner as the "
"timeline. It is organized in columns, and columns are divided into cells, "
"representing the content of that column in that particular frame. In the "
"columns you can load animation levels, clips, images, audio files or other "
"Xsheets."
msgstr ""
"Xsheet允许您以与时间线相同的方式管理场景内容。它按列组织，列分为单元格，表示特定"
"框架中该列的内容。在列中，您可以加载动画级别、剪辑、图像、音频文件或其他"
"Xsheets。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:501
msgid ""
"Each column has its own header containing information about its content. The "
"column on the far left displays the frame number, with a cursor placed on the "
"current frame. The headers area and the frame column are always visible, even "
"when scrolling the Xsheet area; in this way it's easier to understand how the "
"scene is built."
msgstr ""
"每一列都有自己的标题，其中包含有关其内容的信息。最左侧的列显示帧编号，光标放置在"
"当前帧上。即使滚动Xsheet区域，标题区域和框架列也始终可见；这样更容易理解场景是如"
"何构建的。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:503
msgid "Frames are rendered reading images from left to right in each cell row."
msgstr "帧被渲染为从左到右读取每个单元格行中的图像。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:505 ../../source/interface_overview.rst:521
msgid "See  :ref:`Working in Xsheet <working_in_xsheet>`  ."
msgstr "请参阅：ref:`在Xsheet中工作<Working_in_Xsheet>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:511
msgid "Timeline"
msgstr "时间轴"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:513
msgid "|UI_timeline|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:515
msgid ""
"The timeline allows you to manage the scene content, in the same manner as the "
"Xsheet. It is organized in horizontal layers, and layers are divided into "
"cells, representing the content of that layer in that particular frame. In the "
"layers you can load animation levels, clips, images, audio files or other "
"timelines."
msgstr ""
"时间线允许您以与Xsheet相同的方式管理场景内容。它以水平层组织，层被划分为单元格，"
"表示该特定帧中该层的内容。在图层中，您可以加载动画级别、剪辑、图像、音频文件或其"
"他时间线。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:517
msgid ""
"At the leftmost part each layer has its own header containing information about "
"its content. At the top part of the timeline there is a time ruler that "
"displays the frame number, with a cursor placed on the current frame. The "
"headers area and the time ruler are always visible, even when scrolling the "
"timeline area; in this way it's easier to understand how the scene is built."
msgstr ""
"在最左侧，每一层都有自己的标头，其中包含有关其内容的信息。在时间线的顶部有一个显"
"示帧号的时间标尺，光标放置在当前帧上。即使滚动时间线区域，标题区域和时间标尺也始"
"终可见；这样更容易理解场景是如何构建的。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:519
msgid "Frames are rendered reading images from bottom to top in each cell column."
msgstr "在每个单元格列中，从下到上读取图像，从而渲染帧。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:527
msgid "History"
msgstr "历史"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:529
msgid "|UI_history|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:531
msgid ""
"The history pane, lets you check and undo/redo the history of the latest "
"actions performed in the current OpenToonz scene."
msgstr ""
"历史窗格允许您检查和撤消/重做当前OpenToonz场景中执行的最新操作的历史记录。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:533
msgid ""
"See  :ref:`Assigning Memory for the Undo Operation "
"<assigning_memory_for_the_undo_operations>`  ."
msgstr ""
"请参阅：ref:`为撤消操作分配内存<Assigning_Memory_for_the_Undo_operations>`。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:539
msgid "Record Audio"
msgstr "录音"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:541
msgid "|UI_recordaudio|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:543
msgid ""
"The record audio window, lets you record a live audio source, listen to it, and "
"insert it into a new audio column of the Xsheet. The insertion point will be "
"located at the right of the selected cell column, and starting at the selected "
"cell frame."
msgstr ""
"录制音频窗口允许您录制实时音频源，收听并将其插入Xsheet的新音频列。插入点将位于所"
"选单元格列的右侧，并从所选单元格帧开始。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:546
msgid ""
"Currently, this window cannot be docked to form part of a room, like the other "
"ones in the Windows menu. Instead it must be opened as a floating window, when "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"目前，此窗口不能像Windows菜单中的其他窗口那样停靠以形成房间的一部分。相反，在需"
"要时，它必须作为浮动窗口打开。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:552
msgid "Customizing the Interface Appearance"
msgstr "自定义界面外观"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:553
msgid ""
"The appearance of the OpenToonz interface can be customized to suit any "
"production need by choosing a specific language and interface theme."
msgstr ""
"OpenToonz界面的外观可以通过选择特定的语言和界面主题进行定制，以满足任何生产需"
"求。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:555
msgid ""
"OpenToonz allows users to choose a specific language for the software "
"interface, including menus, commands, tooltips, and on-screen messages. "
"Currently available languages are: English, German, Spanish, French, Italian, "
"Russian, Japanese and Chinese."
msgstr ""
"OpenToonz允许用户为软件界面选择特定的语言，包括菜单、命令、工具提示和屏幕消息。"
"目前可用的语言有：英语、德语、西班牙语、法语、意大利语、俄语、日语和中文。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:557
msgid ""
"There are also several included themes to choose from: Default, Blue, Dark, "
"Light and Neutral."
msgstr "还有几个包含的主题可供选择：默认、蓝色、深色、浅色和中性。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:561
msgid "The OpenToonz interface theme set to *Default* and to *Light*."
msgstr "OpenToonz界面主题设置为*Default*和*Light*。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:563
msgid ""
"The interface themes are defined by means of a QSS file, whose concepts, "
"terminology, and syntax are inspired by CSS files (HTML Cascading Style "
"Sheets). The QSS files also refers to a set of PNG images that are used to "
"create interface widgets."
msgstr ""
"界面主题是通过QSS文件定义的，其概念、术语和语法都受到CSS文件（HTML级联样式表）的"
"启发。QSS文件还引用了一组用于创建界面小部件的PNG图像。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:565
msgid ""
"These files are stored in a folder named as the QSS file, and located in the "
"``C:\\OpenToonz stuff\\config\\qss``  folder on Windows and ``OpenToonz stuff"
"\\config\\qss``  folder on Macintosh."
msgstr ""
"这些文件存储在一个名为QSS文件的文件夹中，在Windows上位于“C:\\OpenToonz stuff"
"\\config\\QSS”文件夹，在Macintosh上位于“OpenToonz tuff\\config”文件夹。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:567
msgid "The QSS file for Macintosh is named with the _mac suffix."
msgstr "Macintosh的QSS文件以_mac后缀命名。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:569
msgid ""
"The QSS file can be edited with any text editor software, e.g. Notepad or "
"TextEdit; the PNG images with any image editor software. Editing the QSS file "
"requires some skill in CSS language, but some changes like colors of pane "
"elements, can be easily done by expressing them with red, green and blue values."
msgstr ""
"QSS文件可以用任何文本编辑器软件进行编辑，例如记事本或TextEdit；使用任何图像编辑"
"器软件对PNG图像进行编辑。编辑QSS文件需要一些CSS语言技能，但一些更改，如窗格元素"
"的颜色，可以通过用红色、绿色和蓝色值表示来轻松完成。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:571
msgid ""
"The QSS files defining the colors and the images used in the OpenToonz "
"interface have to be written according to a specific syntax, otherwise "
"OpenToonz interface will not be displayed properly. If you decide to edit a QSS "
"file, make a backup copy first in case you need to revert the file to the "
"original version."
msgstr ""
"定义OpenToonz界面中使用的颜色和图像的QSS文件必须按照特定的语法编写，否则"
"OpenToonz接口将无法正常显示。如果您决定编辑QSS文件，请先制作一个备份副本，以防需"
"要将文件还原为原始版本。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:573
msgid "**To choose the interface language:**"
msgstr "**要选择界面语言：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:575 ../../source/interface_overview.rst:583
msgid "Choose File  →  Preferences...  →  Interface."
msgstr "选择文件→  偏好。..  →  接口。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:577
msgid ""
"In the Language* option menu choose the language you want to use in the "
"interface."
msgstr "在Language*选项菜单中，选择要在界面中使用的语言。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:579
msgid "Restart OpenToonz to have the interface in the selected language."
msgstr "重新启动OpenToonz，使界面使用所选语言。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:581
msgid "**To choose the interface theme:**"
msgstr "**要选择界面主题，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:585
msgid "In the Theme option menu choose the style to be applied to the interface."
msgstr "在“主题”选项菜单中，选择要应用于界面的样式。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:587
msgid "**To create a new theme:**"
msgstr "**要创建新主题，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:589
msgid ""
"Navigate to ``C:\\OpenToonz stuff\\config\\qss``  folder on Windows and "
"``OpenToonz stuff\\config\\qss``  folder on Macintosh."
msgstr ""
"导航到Windows上的“C:\\OpenToonz stuff\\config\\qss”文件夹和Macintosh上"
"的“OpenToonz stoff\\config-qss”目录。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:591
msgid "Duplicate one of the already existing style folder."
msgstr "复制一个已存在的样式文件夹。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:593
msgid ""
"Rename the folder and the QSS files inside it with the name you want to assign "
"to the style."
msgstr "使用要指定给样式的名称重命名文件夹及其内的QSS文件。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:595
msgid "Edit the QSS file and the PNG images contained in the new folder."
msgstr "编辑QSS文件和新文件夹中包含的PNG图像。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:597
msgid ""
"The new style will be available in the Preferences dialog the next time you run "
"OpenToonz."
msgstr "下次运行OpenToonz时，新样式将在“首选项”对话框中可用。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:599
msgid "**To edit style QSS file:**"
msgstr "**要编辑样式QSS文件，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:601
msgid ""
"Open and edit with a text editor software (e.g. Notepad or TextEdit) the QSS "
"files available in the style folder."
msgstr ""
"使用文本编辑器软件（如记事本或TextEdit）打开并编辑样式文件夹中可用的QSS文件。"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:603
msgid "**To edit style images:**"
msgstr "**要编辑样式图像，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/interface_overview.rst:605
msgid ""
"Open and edit with an image editor software the PNG files available in the "
"style folder."
msgstr "使用图像编辑器软件打开并编辑样式文件夹中的PNG文件。"
